Third-party material vendored under this directory
==================================================

This directory holds material copied from the upstream bpfix project, plus a
few index files that bpfix-adversarial generates from it. The copied material is
not original to bpfix-adversarial; it is redistributed here so that the
evaluation can be reproduced against a fixed upstream tree.

    Upstream:  eunomia-bpf/bpfix
               https://github.com/eunomia-bpf/bpfix
    Pin:       81d97e4a528456e0082a77f4fb6edd13fa092b7b (2026-07-11)
    Paper:     Zheng et al., arXiv:2607.02748
    License:   MIT

Copied verbatim from upstream (MIT, notice below):

    bpfix-source-rs-pin/source.rs       upstream source-comment heuristics
    bpfix-source-rs-pin/classifier.rs   upstream error-ID to obligation map
    bpfix-bench-cases/<case>/           buggy.bpf.c, fixed.bpf.c, README.md,
                                        diagnostic.txt, verifier.log (21 cases)

Generated by bpfix-adversarial from upstream data (not upstream files):

    main75_upstream_diagnostics.json    error ID, headline and SHA-256 of each
                                        main75 diagnostic.txt
                                        (tools/vendor_main75_diagnostics.py)
    main75_case_index.json              main75 case list with the harness's
                                        keyword_label
    subset_seed.json                    depth-21 selection
    depth21_manifest.json               fetch manifest for the 21-case subset
    bpfix-bench-cases/<case>/case_meta.json
                                        per-case fetch metadata
                                        (tools/fetch_depth21_upstream.py)

